Maintainer: Anhky <dev@tolome.net>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: tolome-keyboard-fon
Architecture: all
Depends: xkb-data, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Fongbe (fon) keyboard layout for Tolome
 Adds the "fon" XKB layout (Fongbe, Benin) with the letters ɔ ɛ ɖ and
 the tone and vowel diacritics used to write Fon.
 .
 The layout is installed beside the files of xkb-data, without modifying
 them, and is selectable in GNOME under X11 and Wayland.
